{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34676086",
      "title": "Using Action & Loader Headers",
      "lectureOrder": 108,
      "videoOrder": 101,
      "sourceHash": "d07ee6845facd9d018e57d2b8704f2b03341ed8c26810541aa9b14a95b761e76",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "Now regarding headers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 5.25,
          "en": "you of course also might wonder what's up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.25,
          "end": 7.95,
          "en": "with action and loader headers?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.95,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "Well, to understand that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "it's important to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "that your loaders and your actions do return responses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 19.14,
          "en": "I talked about that multiple times throughout this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "and also in this section already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "You can return raw data, but in that case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 27.297,
          "en": "it will be wrapped into a response by a Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.297,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "Now if you do return a response on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 33.65,
          "en": "like for example, here in expenses JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.65,
          "end": 37.453,
          "en": "then you can also set some extra response settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.453,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "like for example, the headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 42.21,
          "en": "And that's not just possible in a loader,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 44.606,
          "en": "but also in an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.606,
          "end": 49.606,
          "en": "And here you could then add the Cache-Control header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "for the expenses and set this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "to max age equals three to only cache it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 59.19,
          "en": "for three seconds since it might change all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.19,
          "end": 61.581,
          "en": "And then you could pick up the headers set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.581,
          "end": 66.581,
          "en": "by your loader by adding your headers function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "and using your loader headers here instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.84,
          "end": 71.455,
          "en": "of parent headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.455,
          "end": 74.44,
          "en": "This allows you to, in the end, set your headers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.44,
          "end": 78.621,
          "en": "your loader, or your action, and then use that information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.621,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "for your page responses in the headers function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 85.28999999999999,
          "en": "by using loader headers or action headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.28999999999999,
          "end": 86.2,
          "en": "So this is simply a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.2,
          "end": 89.85,
          "en": "of getting access to information that might be included",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 93.07,
          "en": "in the loader and that you will reset in the loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.07,
          "end": 95.941,
          "en": "It's all important to understand again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.941,
          "end": 99.69,
          "en": "that this loader might be called on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "in case Remix is preparing this page on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "But once the page was served,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "and you are in a single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 109.844,
          "en": "and you navigate to a different page, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.844,
          "end": 112.97999999999999,
          "en": "here, I'm in the single page application already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.97999999999999,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "since I loaded the page already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 117.72,
          "en": "And if I now click on Get Started to go to my expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.72,
          "end": 121.057,
          "en": "I navigate there in a single page application mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.057,
          "end": 124.65,
          "en": "As a result, this page is now not rendered on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.65,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "but instead on the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 128.73,
          "en": "But of course, the data still needs to be fetched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.73,
          "end": 131.22,
          "en": "Therefore, what happens technically can be seen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "in the Network tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 133.838,
          "en": "As soon as I click Get Started,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.838,
          "end": 138.66,
          "en": "Remix sends a new request to download the expense data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.66,
          "end": 140.22,
          "en": "So it still sends a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.22,
          "end": 142.906,
          "en": "to this loader function on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.906,
          "end": 145.802,
          "en": "So that's why this loader in the end must return a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.802,
          "end": 147.9,
          "en": "because it might be talking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 151.26,
          "en": "to our application in single page app mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.53,
          "en": "Either way, the data encoded here can be picked up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 157.82999999999998,
          "en": "in the headers function to set the page response headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.82999999999998,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "So to set the headers of this overall page response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "which we see if we reload this entire page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 167.223,
          "en": "I'm talking about these response headers here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
